{"type":"message","id":"b5fb6dd3","parentId":"19f03012","timestamp":"2026-05-10T08:27:03.967Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_LoAi4jb1RScBBObHqF1L1XpC|fc_014e291e29987115016a004157303481919f7aaad2e046874f","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Dashboard MVP\n\nLocal, static, read-only dashboard concept for Albert and neodaemon.\n\nSecurity principles:\n- Local files only for now.\n- No public exposure.\n- No network service started automatically.\n- No credentials or secrets stored here.\n- MVP first, iterate slowly.\n\nInitial blocks:\n1. Today\n2. Health / mobility\n3. Habits\n4. Pending / chaos inbox\n\nOpen `index.html` locally when explicitly approved/needed.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778401623967}}
{"type":"message","id":"fdd81899","parentId":"b5fb6dd3","timestamp":"2026-05-10T08:27:03.967Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_gG4E8sBCi0kXdaTV1TSzivd1|fc_014e291e29987115016a004157303c8191b86f3c7e14eaa2eb","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Albert · Dashboard MVP</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: dark;\n      --bg: #0d1117;\n      --panel: #161b22;\n      --panel-2: #1f2630;\n      --text: #e6edf3;\n      --muted: #8b949e;\n      --accent: #58a6ff;\n      --ok: #3fb950;\n      --warn: #d29922;\n      --border: #30363d;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n    main {\n      width: min(960px, 100%);\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    header {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 6px;\n      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 6vw, 2.4rem);\n    }\n    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n    section {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 16px;\n      min-height: 170px;\n    }\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }\n    li { margin: 6px 0; }\n    .pill {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 4px 8px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .85rem;\n      margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .safe { color: var(--ok); }\n    .warn { color: var(--warn); }\n    .metric {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 7px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    .metric:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .metric strong { color: var(--text); text-align: right; }\n    footer {\n      margin-top: 18px;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .9rem;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <header>\n      <h1>Dashboard MVP</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Albert + neodaemon · local, privado, mínimo viable</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <section>\n        <h2>Hoy</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Prioridad del día: pendiente de definir.</li>\n          <li>Top 3 tareas: usar el log diario.</li>\n          <li>Resumen diario: programado a las 09:00.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Fuente futura: /daily/YYYY/MM/DD.md</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Salud / movilidad</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Dolor 0-10: —</li>\n          <li>Rigidez matutina: —</li>\n          <li>Estiramientos: —</li>\n          <li>Notas: seguimiento prudente, no médico.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">MVP salud</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Hábitos</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Sueño: —</li>\n          <li>Alimentación: —</li>\n          <li>Deporte: —</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Pilares diarios</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Pendientes / caos</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Capturar cosas sueltas aquí.</li>\n          <li>Ordenar por prioridad.</li>\n          <li>Convertir caos en próximos pasos.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill warn\">Anticaos</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Uso LLM / tokens</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens entrada</span><strong>6.0k</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens salida</span><strong>298</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Contexto</span><strong>18k / 272k · 7%</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Cache</span><strong>73% hit · 16k cached</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Límite diario</span><strong>96% libre · ~3h 29m</strong></div>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Snapshot manual · 2026-05-10 09:30 CEST</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Seguridad</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li><span class=\"safe\">Privado por defecto.</span></li>\n          <li>No expuesto a internet.</li>\n          <li>Sin credenciales en el proyecto.</li>\n          <li>Core intocable para neodaemon.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Solo Albert + neodaemon</span>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n      MVP estático. Siguiente iteración: leer datos reales del log diario, sin abrir acceso externo todavía.\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778401623967}}
