{"type":"message","id":"8872826b","parentId":"bb0bb4ce","timestamp":"2026-05-10T08:35:05.852Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Claro, Albert.\n\nEn Ubuntu, desde terminal:\n\n```bash\nxdg-open /openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\nSi estás dentro del workspace:\n\n```bash\ncd /openclaw/workspace\nxdg-open dashboard/index.html\n```\n\nEso lo abre en el navegador local.  \nAlternativa manual: abre el archivo `dashboard/index.html` con Firefox/Chrome.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a0043382dd88191b2e21aade482afec\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":1504,"output":84,"cacheRead":39936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41524,"cost":{"input":0.007520000000000001,"output":0.00252,"cacheRead":0.019968,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.030008}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778402103242,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a0043377f308191955ea7ed44defab3"}}
