{"type":"message","id":"6bce2fea","parentId":"d3fd6651","timestamp":"2026-05-10T08:41:04.494Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"El archivo **sí existe en el host `bunker-ia`**:\n\n```bash\n/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\nSi Ubuntu te dice “archivo no encontrado”, probablemente estás ejecutando el comando en **otro entorno**: tu PC Ubuntu local, no dentro del host/contenedor donde vive OpenClaw.\n\nPrueba esto en la terminal donde tengas OpenClaw:\n\n```bash\nls -l /openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\nSi existe, ábrelo con:\n\n```bash\nfirefox file:///openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\no:\n\n```bash\nxdg-open file:///openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\nSi ese `ls` también falla, dime desde qué terminal estás: **Ubuntu local, SSH al bunker, contenedor, o TUI de OpenClaw**. Ahí está la diferencia.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a00449ce1e48191a264edd124b2c8b6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":897,"output":190,"cacheRead":40960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42047,"cost":{"input":0.004485,"output":0.0057,"cacheRead":0.020479999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.030664999999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778402459903,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a00449c33f881918d19769eb05f62ee"}}
