{"type":"message","id":"c448c4b7","parentId":"41a0eda6","timestamp":"2026-05-10T11:58:04.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfecto: entonces tu ruta real desde esa terminal es:\n\n```bash\n./openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\nÁbrelo así:\n\n```bash\nxdg-open ./openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\no con Firefox:\n\n```bash\nfirefox ./openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\nTambién vale con ruta absoluta si estás en tu home:\n\n```bash\nxdg-open ~/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html\n```\n\nEl fallo era que yo te di `/openclaw/...`, pero en tu Ubuntu lo tienes como `~/openclaw/...`.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a0072ca73f88191b39edfab411fb168\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":36433,"output":131,"cacheRead":5632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42196,"cost":{"input":0.18216500000000002,"output":0.00393,"cacheRead":0.002816,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.18891100000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778414279324,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a0072c89d548191bf3a704314b4c202"}}
