{"type":"message","id":"dd8b6687","parentId":"6c432876","timestamp":"2026-05-10T12:02:54.765Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Eso parece un problema de **Snap/Firefox**, no del dashboard.\n\nEl archivo existe; lo que falla es que el navegador instalado como Snap intenta montar rutas del sistema en modo solo lectura.\n\nPrueba primero con navegador no-Snap si tienes:\n\n```bash\ngoogle-chrome \"$(realpath ./openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html)\"\n```\n\no:\n\n```bash\nchromium-browser \"$(realpath ./openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html)\"\n```\n\nSi no, prueba con Firefox usando URL `file://` completa:\n\n```bash\nfirefox \"file://$(realpath ./openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html)\"\n```\n\nTambién puedes abrirlo desde el gestor de archivos:\n\n```bash\nnautilus \"$(dirname \"$(realpath ./openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html)\")\"\n```\n\ny doble clic en `index.html`.\n\nSi nada abre, dime qué devuelve:\n\n```bash\nwhich firefox\nsnap list firefox\nwhich xdg-open\necho \"$XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP\"\n```","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a0073eae7948191a7ac11c336f7ea2e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":702,"output":208,"cacheRead":41984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42894,"cost":{"input":0.00351,"output":0.00624,"cacheRead":0.020992,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.030742}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778414568657,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a0073e944688191abae4e429e02e673"}}
