6jzMSSerVDLm7Yk_H1JznmMkz08VJNemV-ZoRUKLgU4qM0nbjr_gb0ZBLWiATUVCjNyytXbmuTfJkzBB3hJRsYG5KMV4YU9oxBkQzIPHyScrBV9wRoqjNeMqDFjbq7Rs8ykwSNIyosJmLS1GjFaz0_gTVyAEECIUBImXMRaTprp-Rbx71Z7IYMJQRlCVKENkFYdFJZ62JfnHHUXxV8ZTt5NOZDb73yjcIyO1rjLbBHBkIP1ATa4egwRojguW1vsksp0sRsXl5T74VRe0Kx3kE_nB-Rf7bnPPBrDDz7F4eWuytTIkapvLYpt3wE12ZqENtPFuQLri0dTTzD2134GXyNGB0vmA5pOam8sZMPHjKdt5-ps9IVvxfyS2T3PTfG8W2rVfYPbdvE12x7Vo0R4bH8fTf8nl7G3H1C98pJND4TXMeCFMO5CWONUwRJqcvDCsDhaJOfVdB98Si46TTRh0DXY-BzWR_aUlbo9_0LW3NWGmsyYuMbUpJaxsoFtLmitXWqAifgG8jlLFu9rOwaiRH5Ox4RvwpPwNAnFeJ4xTLMYGv5UaOSlmaODDMa1nFr0uYOiyF-1Ug9RHFDAOLYZAKOtUjK3rh97CRcus9pfUywiNfqyEaiMje14GAaDeb8y0aleMDrVS4N5cS5v50cICRmCfVC3OWVnVdIE3KlTyMSzqAa7FeZ9MtsgCmehUCSCt1oI0WdG0HCdSQeLRmG9h91qPbm6ELNRhmUSNd7nbnislCO9zAueEvEq_PgWxeqZtg1fn2SdjOMeRMBvdV1zMc87pMDK4BiFDAlxTKeLhxjYoHACYuZ4aZWpon60ghVpyim53CplNJuPekOIctbDX37owbvSMSveF6MQjBg=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Troubleshooting access issues**\\n\\nI see that we need an answer, and it looks like we're dealing with some current troubleshooting steps. Maybe I should suggest a snap issue and mention using a local simple server, which ideally should cost nothing. It could be helpful to have the user run a Python HTTP server in their directory to avoid file mount issues. I’ll need to keep my advice clear and concise, and perhaps consider generating a command for their Ubuntu setup. Finally, I could provide a message in Spanish as well.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Sí: tu Firefox es **Snap**, y esos errores encajan con el aislamiento de Snap. La forma más limpia es abrir el dashboard como web local, no como archivo.\n\nDesde la carpeta donde te funcionó el `ls`, ejecuta:\n\n```bash\ncd \"$(dirname \"$(realpath ./openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html)\")\"\npython3 -m http.server 8765 --bind 127.0.0.1\n```\n\nDéjalo abierto. Luego en Firefox abre:\n\n```text\nhttp://127.0.0.1:8765/\n```\n\nEsto no expone nada a internet: solo escucha en tu propio ordenador.\n\nPara cerrar el servidor: `Ctrl + C` en esa terminal.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a007704e2748191ad7866711f78406c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":983,"output":342,"cacheRead":41984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43309,"cost":{"input":0.004915,"output":0.01026,"cacheRead":0.020992,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.036167000000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778415357664,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a0076fe5fec81918a216be44997aa2b"}}
