{"type":"message","id":"13e52fe6","parentId":"ecd379e8","timestamp":"2026-05-10T12:20:33.648Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Structuring an empathetic response**\n\nI need to respond with empathy and figure out the user’s situation. Since they’ve repeated information, it seems likely they’re facing a local issue. However, our setups are different, so I should focus on inspecting their current files.\n\nI can explain that the dashboard is static in the OpenClaw workspace, but their shell path differs due to a Snap Firefox file access issue. Then, I'll offer concrete steps to help them run a server command and serve the directory. If needed, I’ll also mention an alternative command for locating their file.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_014e291e29987115016a00780758d48191b2974e18b859213c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqAHgO5mtUyuRSz8wTtVAMsPm1Q2QXSASBeZKYzyOeG9afJazsB-OjaUv_swXSSV_m4GVUH8dCBUWPbmkC-0IqSKtAepUajqqm0IA0CHwC6IFYMdXJSD8772dPlS_AAf-ocKHmWB5DIqpq5cQSOE6HoaNpyTyKUjstVmxyKQn42Q5S-HTbE0WuNLAhTNgY7C-BD_7ysw8NC9DhT31GWjKdt5tx3GvoJDt6Vy2ey6UxDmZh40lzQP3wLSxAFxK4_U92HnjJaA4jDsNEpaqsCj0r3eJHmCI-RFbNBx6__hPTHX7xndvkniTQQ0jlEz_YC-JP6b_eGeAm9a46vx7lzKkmwQI9yb5jh7EAkg1fmhW6d4Snh0Pq_7wvKZTzGy43-q7KWGE5jInxVbVNAhpi7lD3ecfoABe4xmd1wYtHrPGr4J8XYTxAzIQE2lXiRVYPJHMSloyBn0t6MaI2JEmqBqQTxrtBF77pGPthnvrLnhKeveXhf6iVEqabyV9MYC5e-pvRzyLF2iDR2A3UZuhbP5ewHRd2YP_4fsZ_0-vcNoZSZKoRsSxyML4jwn_N9ireTf6MKWSs_ukMUQYsj9xa6Chc_iN_1anAdoeP-QCxr_TXjpsNR4GbgPlSkYQH_QU_giv49aMalhlNL1OgnLlDyFCB8pGx2E3APaEyH-JeYncLBC4C9KIDyFRbn_T3muFB-os7lOG1czesI8tztSIiIa54aOuioqHFmYzdl8k4m17X6LAhju0Ee22srZv6D6MbNiZnn4PFUaqgCQVZ6sc6JYmRnDdLBR94tQZwX2t-chsDx9wraNovfQ4DMtgQMB_JWS00g-ONocKg69NYwNtEISn111vVrnkWewRD1zC1FgWQP2rzd0wVp9dGJ4p6I_HF30tufTEHhFAFvXepuoDha8cuIh3sgbNwuJn_fHDDuGqA1ktIAn7sM0_ekZG4JSq4d_HDfu1sqmdwJAdiJS-z7_pawIDGAr0lGRD8MWvxL8_3h1aog32tgtYTY7C2igZqrF1r1HvLapnXlaHeAj8v0wKnuhOtmMwqeW6MqJiLLg3zlxN74keJszKbqst3KVVLJBYS2aVk5Fzij8l