{"type":"message","id":"f94bb6d5","parentId":"c6cd3b4d","timestamp":"2026-05-10T12:23:34.053Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hecho, Albert. He creado:\n\n```bash\n~/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/open-dashboard.sh\n~/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/neodaemon-dashboard.desktop\n```\n\nAhora en Ubuntu ejecuta:\n\n```bash\ncp ~/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/neodaemon-dashboard.desktop ~/Escritorio/\nchmod +x ~/Escritorio/neodaemon-dashboard.desktop\n```\n\nLuego haz doble clic en el icono **Neodaemon Dashboard**.\n\nSi Ubuntu te pregunta si confías en el lanzador, marca **“Confiar y ejecutar”**.\n\nQué hace:\n- levanta el dashboard local en `127.0.0.1:8765`\n- abre el navegador automáticamente\n- no expone internet\n- coste 0€","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a0078c306448191ac1eb24846b9cecc\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":332,"output":160,"cacheRead":44544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45036,"cost":{"input":0.0016600000000000002,"output":0.0048000000000000004,"cacheRead":0.022272,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.028732}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778415808531,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a0078c12220819190ebbfaecb367af7"}}
