{"type":"message","id":"d3127184","parentId":"2b4a1015","timestamp":"2026-05-10T12:33:08.926Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Addressing VirtualBox Issues**\n\nI’m thinking about the user's need regarding VirtualBox guest additions, particularly the display auto-resize feature. It seems they might not have the necessary skills or knowledge. I’m not focusing on previous health issues, but rather on the current situation. I could ask for clarification or provide guidance on how to address this problem in a concise way. It’s essential to keep things clear and straightforward to help the user effectively.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_014e291e29987115016a007aff929c8191a537354cb64d6664\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqAHsBnLJDG_U3m4PRlAC0gbAQymB5bumofDM9J_MhQrg3mpmEyQ9r9ZbyOHa08aSqWgRzbWTYO0El01uxEZNk1kV2BlS5rSXJnLIyQvP3kfJKExudCpwytaj8QOgtHjwqxAWT9rH5VlRu06GPyS6I3J3tyrvrXlbIuKdPGKe1mypyOdlqWAmAvn_AGtT3bgVRqvTkduhDMkjI4xiB5moSM9KNi1UakyoeWGfL8obgqrAspwadaDiLCDqu7uGfc09xqcHO0JXEW2Zc9rWpa3cTOUVmfPvTIgGQEf5jjIUynoWdavx9nZyDiBvHHskdY27PTfS9fdWJDlmeqCHhiZbthEl5ri3yMepjC8FewrXWwDr6oMbAO1Y5tI4GsqiQRavP_Wl_hMMVESzL9bSjZ-tMtgHbQ_c-X6Xlmx16nQujgwBFMWH-Iz_4eAyjO5eLl5nbLYq-QzmRlGu80m1jjalZlTIxd1B3IjirwnUDCYe_xIg9DFSG3El1shjngbKwDQ07hfpcwTqeUw-fs2rtC3e8gz4lpxwWjhxk0V_97j-gp6Ggr7fWEUVhj7nWb9uGN7UF_tV76suwfdFiZHiSb2z835RQdCPvAVsjRb_YtU5teJBEO-qcvBtebHD5uhwtl7t5X-WGA98pTt4fpgbC7vMM8Msj26PipnN4RLWY7kt32h0atCfTi5AiJfWmw6fzyjkJp_zXYJRGK5OZrMgsT1oRg4ebc7KpcqnuzC3RPmoHhn1NZBBLghPp11u1IQGpG5Y-txM5IpJ4iFz56sV1Ynkow2js8jmXTQKB6oXOwkrYRDeMHrHHcNoL4Rc1-ns2RHK62jlpX5KBQInDwqbIKnrFe-3KfMWPo5rnDnPKitmdlf0OeOQneYFxqCAvLfqDKDaJse4FoJpyqoiW-hv4ppF7rQLMQ3gflTt_bPpNMZqgDTqE6p6x_5H4ZX9e54cyzBhQCgJKpaAwiOHvKwD1taODWugtM_2uyTEYlUug5im_OIGgYYhADk8GDsZ5VDeKzy7YcaxAKNANAMxkidbAvWIWAb7MEk_bwFFLnTcMV2v6uq7um9Bn_GPXVDqA_t4TpAOqXucVbyxKrkfmi3sI6nD4i_jwlmEQ5agZ_e01io3h_xrtpnKRQAB95ngmIhI3c2v8e2I_MgrDI-V0Z160JGPCz7fqrg==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Addressing VirtualBox Issues**\\n\\nI’m thinking about the user's need regarding VirtualBox guest additions, particularly the display auto-resize feature. It seems they might not have the necessary skills or knowledge. I’m not focusing on previous health issues, but rather on the current situation. I could ask for clarification or provide guidance on how to address this problem in a concise way. It’s essential to keep things clear and straightforward to help the user effectively.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Sí, eso suele pasar en VirtualBox cuando Ubuntu no tiene bien activado el ajuste automático de pantalla.\n\nPrueba en este orden:\n\n**1. En la ventana de VirtualBox**\nArriba en el menú:\n\n```text\nVer → Pantalla virtual 1 → Redimensionar a 1920x1080\n```\n\no elige una resolución más grande.\n\n**2. Activa auto-ajuste**\nEn el menú de VirtualBox:\n\n```text\nVer → Redimensionar automáticamente pantalla invitado\n```\n\nAtajo habitual:\n\n```text\nHost + G\n```\n\nLa tecla **Host** normalmente es `Ctrl derecho`.\n\n**3. Si no funciona: instalar Guest Additions**\nDentro de Ubuntu abre terminal y ejecuta:\n\n```bash\nsudo apt update\nsudo apt install -y virtualbox-guest-utils virtualbox-guest-x11\nsudo reboot\n```\n\nDespués de reiniciar, prueba otra vez:\n\n```text\nVer → Redimensionar automáticamente pantalla invitado\n```\n\nMi recomendación: primero prueba **Host + G** y maximizar la ventana. Si no cambia, instala Guest Additions.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a007b016cfc8191ad02f7ae1126fad6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":35101,"output":284,"cacheRead":11776,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47161,"cost":{"input":0.17550500000000002,"output":0.00852,"cacheRead":0.005888,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.18991300000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778416381654,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a007afe498081