{"type":"message","id":"7b4e9292","parentId":"13f9c405","timestamp":"2026-05-10T13:08:54.513Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He integrado el PDF en nuestro protocolo local, Albert.\n\nArchivo actualizado:\n\n```text\npersonal/albert/protocolo-acceso-internet.md\n```\n\nCambios importantes añadidos:\n- **Fase 0 obligatoria** antes de habilitar Internet.\n- Gateway estable 7 días.\n- Backups activos.\n- Herramientas no usadas auditadas/deshabilitadas.\n- Sandbox obligatorio.\n- Logging de URLs, motivo, tokens, duración, errores.\n- Allowlist inicial de dominios.\n- Rate limiting.\n- Modo observación 7–14 días.\n- Kill-switch y rollback antes de activar nada.\n\nY punto clave: **esto NO habilita Internet todavía**. Solo deja el protocolo más seguro y ordenado.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a00836388f48191b2c024708083e240\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":612,"output":154,"cacheRead":56832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57598,"cost":{"input":0.0030600000000000002,"output":0.00462,"cacheRead":0.028416,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.036096}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778418526856,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a00835f296081918d05fd12fa1a1a9b"}}
