{"type":"message","id":"f8a20cc1","parentId":"5d83470c","timestamp":"2026-05-10T13:20:37.835Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sí, Albert. Y me gusta mucho esa tríada como brújula:\n\n**Orden** → carpetas claras, logs diarios, dashboard, métricas.  \n**Rigor** → medir tokens, estabilidad, tareas útiles, alertas.  \n**Seguridad** → coste 0€, protocolo antes de Internet, no exponer OpenClaw, aprobación humana.\n\nYo lo resumiría así:\n\n```text\nPrimero ordenar.\nLuego medir.\nDespués automatizar solo lo seguro.\n```\n\nEse debería ser nuestro criterio para todo lo que construyamos.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a00862391888191a31e8e3eb1cd91d8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":1706,"output":117,"cacheRead":61952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63775,"cost":{"input":0.008530000000000001,"output":0.00351,"cacheRead":0.030976,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.043016}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778419234555,"responseId":"resp_014e291e29987115016a008622c6108191aa8f51ab1dd3d36d"}}
