{"type":"message","id":"aaf2fa3f","parentId":"caf11d10","timestamp":"2026-05-10T17:01:04.930Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering plugin audit needs**\n\nI'm thinking about what we need to do to audit plugins and tools. Should I ask for permission and access? The user asked, \"qué necesitas para poder hacerlo?\", which likely implies we should consider disabling unused tools. I'll outline what we can do, noting that no passwords are required. I wonder if we can also inspect the available tools and use local docs. A concise response seems necessary!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_014e291e29987115016a00b9ca84e88191b6613462cbd94903\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqALnNGPWGOwaQSo6JQQjgHwie_QVBrgtzUd5DPMsJZL9lKfPhQ_DsozoI5Gr6-owoPhSyXmh7ZE5krbr8uGb_mUpZotHWr0JK-gQmP5m2YQy4lVmehmwj6WhH-2tO1z1dV3ThLoya0O0M9ZNLTBqP1khxHV83MkFkaRXY9amSwCMTLYPbFOBi3ejztq2fJKBr-M2pzGhxzS9t8EkQhPa1S7-yMKRcIKPK3uy6wxJqR-TO5soq7GlI98fy3ACL3ntJzIbccVslBUJKyhUwe9S7wFeem96UKTSe39eBrs4xYfiYqZZT7GggRb2mCY8-pVlraqNnspb3bwRc2zm0iy5aBINM9drE9JoDASN_9fJnWt1Q_FT0l42df9US5jO5iZ10oDUaX3_P-8FXJnXGwwR3AZsgRzOq7RtSQt7LEWZ5ZBrskEE920Bc6ZoZ7WR5MpY6EPc_GlqUab11IM7mAp_38uZkeUalD56AaJMmtkNmrCFZpmwuJ8vfzSBfsMYpdfnjbii48StBZLdbCW9YFKzASaTYH38mPQHnDUWl5VYNkEIAAZ91Iko50ilkHAP550Tom5RoqyFhtQJDIUSzDCx37mJUWBkFypzLP-lFuGu8Rm42_qq5no02IM038mK2Ed1Fz356n2sgJQgpEN54d8hKnnEuIqDSs4iLKbHgAtUws8vAac97Fjrzm2U1FY1M7bcNPITrO_pgPNzPOIsqap6ALhYwEH_vcEwGJ1r6dMB-7IqWs0XifXN_Jch9b8b8GDY5DN2QrpuERGVw25OiJPPYrHSJLcRpGWhfSXUrrME0BrkPMO5dlJUtZyTpURKCqzmxaTIspIVmvaU_EhCIXY1fuA-JiAEBjiDwkD6JnG5sXlOn5et0-LzIGE2wraofaoazgCDa0XIpEsUZ1ckF3mTdTmWOXaALEOwkdx1m1eGPneTJUN-i47pCNwnzwrEl7I9_Jeu7A1qw2ZtusZUvw5b-PLrjy1ZN3n-WW_2G3YIVPAWf8NPigCfV8DVOiVyWiza9NYNAH19ZWibzumyMQ08tKfzDrVS4wm3rZWMDF_zd-igXTtguzIpTYjn6MdNQY2NqTsXgi9u8Y1XcKjLqwEsgm-IZrry--muaBam-phoXdUPxGiFd0BXGOeti2P5J1WocPsNdMDmKtO66mz0zLI2ZrzocMGJ-23TwE3WcudeuwF6BFteo-5pWg6EUksH894CEBNOoUmXzRUmuaPHUwcO--uWgtqQWI-7Ff71_PP4-vtj-rdmnhPiHTwAiPmmQmmjiK-3pCxqfiiNm215t0IO_4TwyKOSKt6NzzMwZl2qCqGL_0MMhtzxRO5Qu_1W1u7SxE6QKzVPzJF8vYBDe-mVQI2PDtHC8OYhvcr1COd-i9agpxSPlIMZuPOrksF2TnFHXpUj4phcQDpbVV-rcXWeweIgwk5ZXagUICvTawTgd3Jdh5ut-c4sA34UKFavTX-6pqUjYw9L3mJS7dRww-kIHOs6TASltzCtfj8SFXovXMWODMU2GWnPGlYv9MOq9mZVUAZ64\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering plugin audit needs**\\n\\nI'm thinking about what we need to do to audit plugins and tools. Should I ask for permission and access? The user asked, \\\"qué necesitas para poder hacerlo?\\\", which likely implies we should consider disabling unused tools. I'll outline what we can do, noting that no passwords are required. I wonder if we can also inspect the available tools and use local docs. A concise response seems necessary!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Para hacerlo bien necesito muy poco, Albert:\n\n1. **Tu aprobación**\n   - Para hacer una auditoría de plugins/tools instalados.\n   - Solo lectura al principio: no desactivo nada sin consultarte.\n\n2. **Acceso local al sistema OpenClaw**\n   - Ya lo tengo parcialmente desde esta sesión.\n   - Puedo revisar archivos, configuración visible, dashboard, logs y tools disponibles.\n\n3. **Una regla clara**\n   Clasificar cada tool/plugin como:\n   - **Necesario**\n   - **Útil pero no crítico**\n   - **No usado**\n   - **Riesgoso**\n   - **Candidato a desactivar**\n\n4. **Nada de contraseñas**\n   - No necesito claves, Gmail, hosting ni credenciales para esta auditoría.\n\nMi propuesta MVP:\n\n```text\n1. Inventario de tools/plugins visibles.\n2. Clasificación por utilidad y riesgo.\n3. Reporte simple.\n4. Tú decides qué se desactiva.\n5. Solo entonces aplicamos cambios.\n```\n\nSi me dices **“aprobado auditar tools/plugins”**, empiezo solo con lectura y te doy el informe.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_014e291e29987115016a00b9cd61a88191b1c32583841af98d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5",